  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 2nd level or higher, a barb can avoid damage from many area-effect attacks. If a barb makes a successful Reflex saving throw against an attack that normally deals half damage on a successful save, they instead take no damage. Evasion can be used only if a barb is wearing light armor or no armor. A helpless barb does not gain the benefit of evasion.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/barb#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
